1
00:00:43,210 --> 00:00:46,544
=Born Again=

2
00:00:46,544 --> 00:00:49,558
=Episode 23=

3
00:01:04,960 --> 00:01:06,134
Ye Shen,

4
00:01:06,480 --> 00:01:08,160
why did you leave on your own yesterday

5
00:01:08,160 --> 00:01:09,240
without Xia Na and me?

6
00:01:09,720 --> 00:01:11,760
Something came up at home yesterday.

7
00:01:28,920 --> 00:01:30,080
I want to ask you something.

8
00:01:35,560 --> 00:01:36,636
Are you sure

9
00:01:37,200 --> 00:01:38,913
you confessed to the girl you like?

10
00:01:45,240 --> 00:01:46,360
And are you sure

11
00:01:47,360 --> 00:01:48,400
she

12
00:01:50,720 --> 00:01:51,760
heard you?

13
00:01:53,800 --> 00:01:56,280
(He's the most important person
to me right now.)

14
00:01:56,800 --> 00:01:58,360
I can't risk turning what we have

15
00:01:58,720 --> 00:02:00,200
into something

16
00:02:00,640 --> 00:02:02,520
that could fall apart and cost me him.

17
00:02:04,160 --> 00:02:05,375
I'm sure.

18
00:02:07,200 --> 00:02:08,303
I'm sure

19
00:02:08,880 --> 00:02:09,960
I got my answer.

20
00:02:22,440 --> 00:02:23,480
Well, great prophet.

21
00:02:23,800 --> 00:02:26,360
The officers and I have been
looking everywhere for you.

22
00:02:29,800 --> 00:02:30,854
Officers,

23
00:02:31,040 --> 00:02:32,222
she's Gu Xiaotang.

24
00:02:32,560 --> 00:02:33,611
Are you Gu Xiaotang?

25
00:02:34,360 --> 00:02:36,860
Don't worry. We just need
to ask you a few questions.

26
00:02:50,680 --> 00:02:51,844
Gu Xiaotang,

27
00:02:52,080 --> 00:02:54,040
we need your cooperation
in an investigation.

28
00:02:54,960 --> 00:02:57,000
About Red Star Textile Factory's
explosion,

29
00:02:57,680 --> 00:02:58,845
we received a tip,

30
00:02:58,960 --> 00:03:00,720
claiming that three days before it,

31
00:03:01,360 --> 00:03:03,360
you accurately predicted the incident.

32
00:03:04,480 --> 00:03:05,520
Can you explain

33
00:03:06,200 --> 00:03:08,080
how you knew about it?

34
00:03:08,400 --> 00:03:09,682
Officer,

35
00:03:09,840 --> 00:03:12,160
I was at school
the whole day of the explosion.

36
00:03:12,160 --> 00:03:13,640
The whole class can vouch for me.

37
00:03:14,520 --> 00:03:15,667
Besides,

38
00:03:15,720 --> 00:03:17,880
I don't even know anyone
from that factory.

39
00:03:18,520 --> 00:03:19,824
None of you know, right?

40
00:03:20,320 --> 00:03:23,400
Gu Xiaotang is a suspect
in the recent explosion.

41
00:03:23,400 --> 00:03:24,600
The whole school is talking.

42
00:03:25,440 --> 00:03:28,160
Why was she the only one
who knew it was going to explode?

43
00:03:30,400 --> 00:03:31,591
She's an accomplice.

44
00:03:32,360 --> 00:03:33,494
Or maybe

45
00:03:34,160 --> 00:03:35,200
she isn't even human.

46
00:03:35,880 --> 00:03:36,946
She's a monster.

47
00:03:37,880 --> 00:03:38,880
Lin Wei,

48
00:03:38,880 --> 00:03:39,920
stop talking nonsense!

49
00:03:42,440 --> 00:03:43,444
Lin Wei.

50
00:03:44,400 --> 00:03:45,602
Go to class first.

51
00:03:46,760 --> 00:03:48,840
Want to take down
Ms. Lei and Gu Xiaotang?

52
00:03:49,480 --> 00:03:50,600
What do you mean?

53
00:03:50,600 --> 00:03:51,840
I heard with my own ears

54
00:03:51,840 --> 00:03:54,409
that Gu Xiaotang had told Ms. Lei
about the factory explosion

55
00:03:54,409 --> 00:03:55,617
three days before it.

56
00:03:55,680 --> 00:03:56,880
All you have to do

57
00:03:56,880 --> 00:03:58,000
is spread it at school.

58
00:03:58,000 --> 00:03:59,280
I'll testify to the police.

59
00:03:59,560 --> 00:04:01,520
Then Gu Xiaotang won't dare
act smug anymore.

60
00:04:01,800 --> 00:04:02,880
As for Ms. Lei,

61
00:04:03,240 --> 00:04:04,280
I have a plan for her too.

62
00:04:04,720 --> 00:04:06,640
Without Ms. Lei, Gu Xiaotang is nothing.

63
00:04:07,240 --> 00:04:08,320
When that day comes,

64
00:04:08,320 --> 00:04:09,400
just do whatever you want.

65
00:04:11,120 --> 00:04:12,332
Fine.

66
00:04:12,400 --> 00:04:13,520
You'd better keep your word.

67
00:04:17,560 --> 00:04:18,760
Go back to class.

68
00:04:18,760 --> 00:04:19,995
Let's go.

69
00:04:22,720 --> 00:04:23,760
H-How did it go?

70
00:04:24,640 --> 00:04:25,777
It's fine now.

71
00:04:25,880 --> 00:04:27,440
I have an alibi,

72
00:04:27,440 --> 00:04:29,280
and nothing can link me to the factory.

73
00:04:29,680 --> 00:04:31,120
The police just took a statement.

74
00:04:32,280 --> 00:04:33,360
But I think

75
00:04:34,640 --> 00:04:35,760
something is fishy here.

76
00:04:38,280 --> 00:04:39,320
Look, everyone.

77
00:04:40,800 --> 00:04:41,920
That's Gu Xiaotang.

78
00:04:43,280 --> 00:04:45,160
Not only is she
a suspect in the explosion,

79
00:04:46,360 --> 00:04:47,760
but she's also totally shameless.

80
00:04:48,360 --> 00:04:50,000
She fools around with a boy

81
00:04:50,520 --> 00:04:51,760
and hangs out with gangsters.

82
00:04:52,640 --> 00:04:54,200
Lin Wei, what nonsense are you saying?

83
00:04:54,200 --> 00:04:55,477
Do you have any proof?

84
00:04:55,960 --> 00:04:57,134
Proof?

85
00:04:58,840 --> 00:05:00,394
If I'm not mistaken,

86
00:05:00,880 --> 00:05:02,061
Gu Xiaotang,

87
00:05:02,280 --> 00:05:04,160
your protector, Ms. Lei,

88
00:05:04,560 --> 00:05:06,280
just got busted by the police.

89
00:05:07,148 --> 00:05:09,760
Your days of acting smug are over.

90
00:05:14,720 --> 00:05:15,901
Ms. Lei...

91
00:05:20,960 --> 00:05:22,057
Wait for me.

92
00:05:25,280 --> 00:05:26,640
Winning hand! Pay up now!

93
00:05:27,166 --> 00:05:28,240
Why is it you again?

94
00:05:30,640 --> 00:05:31,760
What are you all doing?

95
00:05:31,760 --> 00:05:32,840
Leave if you want.

96
00:05:33,520 --> 00:05:34,840
Xiaotang keeps saying

97
00:05:35,200 --> 00:05:36,200
we must keep it clean.

98
00:05:36,760 --> 00:05:38,281
You're doing illegal stuff again?

99
00:05:38,600 --> 00:05:39,659
Ms. Lei,

100
00:05:39,873 --> 00:05:41,760
didn't you text us this morning saying

101
00:05:42,400 --> 00:05:43,600
we could unwind a bit

102
00:05:44,320 --> 00:05:45,760
and play a few rounds?

103
00:05:46,040 --> 00:05:47,760
- Yeah.
- When did I ever text you?

104
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:49,043
You...

105
00:05:52,313 --> 00:05:53,457
Where's my phone?

106
00:05:53,863 --> 00:05:55,720
- Who took my phone?
- Nobody move!

107
00:05:56,080 --> 00:05:57,508
Someone reported illegal gambling.

108
00:05:57,614 --> 00:05:58,640
Everyone, get down!

109
00:05:58,640 --> 00:05:59,680
- Get down!
- Get down!

110
00:05:59,880 --> 00:06:00,960
- Don't move!
- Hands behind your heads!

111
00:06:17,800 --> 00:06:18,851
Oh no.

112
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:20,251
Ms. Lei is really in trouble.

113
00:06:21,160 --> 00:06:22,174
That's impossible.

114
00:06:22,240 --> 00:06:23,240
She promised me

115
00:06:23,240 --> 00:06:24,480
no more illegal stuff.

116
00:06:25,880 --> 00:06:27,560
- Someone must've set her up.
- Xiaotang,

117
00:06:27,560 --> 00:06:28,608
calm down.

118
00:06:29,000 --> 00:06:30,372
Let's get out of here first.

119
00:06:41,440 --> 00:06:42,748
Wake up.

120
00:06:53,080 --> 00:06:54,194
Ye Shen.

121
00:06:58,440 --> 00:06:59,591
Finally awake?

122
00:06:59,840 --> 00:07:02,120
Gu Xiaotang, aren't you good
at predicting the future?

123
00:07:03,280 --> 00:07:04,840
Did you ever see this coming?

124
00:07:07,200 --> 00:07:08,600
Can you talk now?

125
00:07:08,600 --> 00:07:10,920
How did you know
about the textile factory explosion

126
00:07:10,920 --> 00:07:12,680
and so many other things in advance?

127
00:07:12,920 --> 00:07:14,351
As long as you talk,

128
00:07:14,440 --> 00:07:15,680
you both will be fine.

129
00:07:23,120 --> 00:07:24,344
If I say I just guessed it,

130
00:07:24,960 --> 00:07:26,040
will you believe me?

131
00:07:26,040 --> 00:07:27,080
You guessed it?

132
00:07:27,080 --> 00:07:28,600
Who are you kidding?

133
00:07:30,680 --> 00:07:31,720
If I don't bleed you,

134
00:07:31,720 --> 00:07:33,240
you won't tell the truth, huh?

135
00:07:36,440 --> 00:07:37,575
Lu Qingyuan,

136
00:07:38,760 --> 00:07:39,840
is that all you've got?

137
00:07:40,640 --> 00:07:41,680
Want my finger again?

138
00:07:54,120 --> 00:07:55,280
Your finger?

139
00:07:56,440 --> 00:07:58,800
What good would that do?

140
00:08:01,173 --> 00:08:02,359
Lu Qingyuan!

141
00:08:02,400 --> 00:08:03,440
What are you doing?

142
00:08:03,680 --> 00:08:04,700
Let him go!

143
00:08:06,000 --> 00:08:07,320
Lu Qingyuan, let him go!

144
00:08:07,840 --> 00:08:08,960
Lu Qingyuan!

145
00:08:08,960 --> 00:08:10,040
Ye Shen!

146
00:08:10,040 --> 00:08:11,880
- Ye Shen, are you okay?
- Ready to behave now?

147
00:08:12,240 --> 00:08:13,271
Talk!

148
00:08:13,271 --> 00:08:14,840
Let him go! Ye Shen!

149
00:08:16,370 --> 00:08:18,680
- Let him go!
- Talk!

150
00:08:18,920 --> 00:08:20,057
Lu Qingyuan!

151
00:08:20,120 --> 00:08:21,169
Ye Shen!

152
00:08:21,480 --> 00:08:22,633
I'll talk!

153
00:08:30,120 --> 00:08:31,130
Ye Shen.

154
00:08:31,480 --> 00:08:32,480
Are you okay, Ye Shen?

155
00:08:33,560 --> 00:08:35,600
I'm fine. Don't worry.

156
00:08:35,920 --> 00:08:37,072
Go ahead.

157
00:08:37,320 --> 00:08:38,504
What's going on?

158
00:08:46,360 --> 00:08:47,653
I'm trapped in loops.

159
00:08:49,680 --> 00:08:51,671
I've relived my life countless times.

160
00:08:53,200 --> 00:08:54,320
For countless times,

161
00:08:55,000 --> 00:08:56,972
I tried so hard to end all this,

162
00:08:57,560 --> 00:08:58,981
but I failed every single time.

163
00:09:00,920 --> 00:09:02,316
If I say I come from the future,

164
00:09:04,000 --> 00:09:05,084
would you believe me?

165
00:09:05,320 --> 00:09:06,463
Who are you trying to fool?

166
00:09:09,320 --> 00:09:10,460
Time travel?

167
00:09:10,800 --> 00:09:12,560
Have you read too many novels?

168
00:09:19,400 --> 00:09:20,680
823823.

169
00:09:21,760 --> 00:09:22,760
Director Li,

170
00:09:22,760 --> 00:09:25,040
same computer password
for over a decade, right?

171
00:09:29,600 --> 00:09:30,680
Lu Qingyuan,

172
00:09:30,720 --> 00:09:32,480
do I need to remind you

173
00:09:32,920 --> 00:09:34,806
that your mother
has a chronic kidney condition?

174
00:09:42,240 --> 00:09:43,580
Since you know so much about us,

175
00:09:43,783 --> 00:09:45,280
why don't you tell us our future?

176
00:09:48,520 --> 00:09:49,811
Your future?

177
00:09:51,520 --> 00:09:53,760
You two will be soaring high.

178
00:09:54,200 --> 00:09:55,304
Director Li,

179
00:09:55,600 --> 00:09:58,233
you become a powerhouse
running the entertainment industry.

180
00:09:58,520 --> 00:09:59,960
You manage countless influencers,

181
00:10:00,480 --> 00:10:02,040
and everyone hangs on your every word.

182
00:10:02,840 --> 00:10:03,951
Lu Qingyuan,

183
00:10:05,480 --> 00:10:07,120
you do even better.

184
00:10:07,720 --> 00:10:09,800
You become the heir to Lu Group,

185
00:10:09,800 --> 00:10:11,320
- worth hundreds of millions.
- Really?

186
00:10:11,960 --> 00:10:13,120
Am I really worth that much?

187
00:10:13,680 --> 00:10:15,920
I... I really made it that big?

188
00:10:26,720 --> 00:10:27,720
Too bad, though.

189
00:10:29,880 --> 00:10:30,979
Last time,

190
00:10:31,480 --> 00:10:32,615
Director Li,

191
00:10:32,880 --> 00:10:34,360
you died by Lu Qingyuan's hand.

192
00:10:36,080 --> 00:10:37,880
Once Lu Qingyuan was done using you,

193
00:10:37,880 --> 00:10:39,775
he tossed you away like trash.

194
00:10:51,880 --> 00:10:53,049
Director Li,

195
00:10:53,320 --> 00:10:54,920
- she's turning us against each other.
- Am I?

196
00:10:55,240 --> 00:10:57,320
I know exactly
what kind of person Lu Qingyuan is.

197
00:10:58,080 --> 00:10:59,200
If he's partnering with you,

198
00:10:59,600 --> 00:11:00,926
he must've had a backup plan.

199
00:11:01,920 --> 00:11:03,240
If I'm not wrong,

200
00:11:03,960 --> 00:11:06,400
he definitely has something
hidden on him.

201
00:11:06,800 --> 00:11:07,920
If you don't believe me,

202
00:11:08,200 --> 00:11:09,280
search him yourself.

203
00:11:09,920 --> 00:11:11,280
No, Director Li.

204
00:11:11,280 --> 00:11:12,329
I don't have it.

205
00:11:12,560 --> 00:11:13,590
Get over here.

206
00:11:13,590 --> 00:11:14,659
- Sit down.
- No.

207
00:11:14,659 --> 00:11:16,440
- Director Li, she's framing me.
- Sit down.

208
00:11:19,760 --> 00:11:20,800
Ye Shen.

209
00:11:20,800 --> 00:11:22,023
Ye Shen, are you okay?

210
00:11:23,320 --> 00:11:24,374
I'm fine.

211
00:11:26,400 --> 00:11:27,600
Stay still. Don't move.

212
00:11:30,006 --> 00:11:31,032
Director Li,

213
00:11:31,193 --> 00:11:32,840
- I didn't...
- Lu Qingyuan,

214
00:11:33,320 --> 00:11:34,762
you dare cross me?

215
00:11:37,080 --> 00:11:38,182
- Director Li!
- Get him!

216
00:11:45,236 --> 00:11:46,380
Darn it!

217
00:11:46,560 --> 00:11:47,800
I'll kill you!

218
00:11:48,200 --> 00:11:49,760
What are you two waiting for? Hit him!

219
00:11:55,763 --> 00:11:57,560
You're asking for death, Lu Qingyuan.

220
00:11:58,760 --> 00:11:59,760
Ye Shen,

221
00:11:59,760 --> 00:12:00,920
got a lollipop with you?

222
00:12:14,360 --> 00:12:15,364
Take this!

223
00:12:17,560 --> 00:12:18,752
Die!

224
00:12:18,880 --> 00:12:19,949
Take this!

225
00:12:21,280 --> 00:12:22,332
Ye Shen.

226
00:12:25,280 --> 00:12:26,560
Trying to run?

227
00:12:28,960 --> 00:12:30,049
Ye Shen.

228
00:12:30,400 --> 00:12:32,160
- Ye Shen!
- Leave me!

229
00:12:32,440 --> 00:12:33,680
Leave me! Run!

230
00:12:42,040 --> 00:12:43,365
- Gu Xiaotang!
- Xiaotang! Ye Shen!

231
00:12:43,365 --> 00:12:44,498
- Freeze!
- They're over there!

232
00:12:44,498 --> 00:12:45,680
- Don't run!
- Don't move!

233
00:12:45,680 --> 00:12:47,480
- Stop right there! Get down!
- Don't run!

234
00:12:47,480 --> 00:12:48,592
- Get down!
- Stop!

235
00:12:48,592 --> 00:12:49,600
Don't run!

236
00:12:49,600 --> 00:12:50,800
I'll call an ambulance!

237
00:12:50,800 --> 00:12:51,819
Stop!

238
00:13:29,909 --> 00:13:33,265
♪The face deep in the heart♪

239
00:13:33,457 --> 00:13:35,919
♪Suddenly clear and hazy♪

240
00:13:37,294 --> 00:13:40,994
♪Across time and space, eyes meet again♪

241
00:13:41,205 --> 00:13:43,645
♪Deeply trapped in the vortex♪

242
00:13:43,792 --> 00:13:46,164
♪Searching for familiar outlines♪

243
00:13:46,314 --> 00:13:49,071
♪Persistently guarding,
endlessly cycling♪

244
00:13:49,071 --> 00:13:51,392
♪Even for just a second♪

245
00:13:52,737 --> 00:13:56,200
♪If raindrops flow backward
into the sky♪

246
00:13:56,328 --> 00:13:58,177
♪And sunlight reverses♪

247
00:13:58,177 --> 00:14:01,647
♪As the sun rises and sets,
we reunite with yesterday♪

248
00:14:02,003 --> 00:14:04,077
♪I'll build a dream with you♪

249
00:14:04,579 --> 00:14:07,988
♪Upon the ruins, spring breeze arrives♪

250
00:14:08,245 --> 00:14:13,457
♪Even if there's no end,
I won't regret the start♪

251
00:14:14,711 --> 00:14:17,276
♪Eternity like a day, rushing to you♪

252
00:14:17,318 --> 00:14:20,771
♪You don't need to recognize my eyes♪

253
00:14:21,348 --> 00:14:24,311
♪Following the tracks
of the days that were♪

254
00:14:25,056 --> 00:14:27,664
♪A day like a lifetime, rushing to you♪

255
00:14:27,664 --> 00:14:31,287
♪You don't need to remember my name♪

256
00:14:31,757 --> 00:14:35,813
♪I'll be the dawn you haven't seen♪
